WEBVTT

00:14:29.496 --> 00:14:35.371
is false evolution or adaptation within
a species was abandoned by biology

00:14:35.371 --> 00:14:42.204
and genetics long ago. Wait a sec. That's
news to me. What have you been reading?

00:14:42.537 --> 00:14:47.204
And I presume this has been pulled out
of some recesses of the Internet,

00:14:47.204 --> 00:14:51.662
but how is it possible, even in theory,

00:14:51.662 --> 00:14:57.454
to imagine how a model can gravitate
towards truth, wisdom,

00:14:57.454 --> 00:15:00.871
as opposed to just like majority views?